        </a></dd>

        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>NIM</dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Microscopy in which television cameras are used to brighten magnified images that are otherwise too dark to be seen with the naked eye. It is used frequently in <a href="/record/ui?ui=D019113" class="textLink_TELEPATHOLOGY">TELEPATHOLOGY</a>.</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Video Microscopy
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Videomicrography
                    
                </dd><dd>
                    Videomicroscopy
                    
                </dd>
                <dt>Previous Indexing</dt>
                
                    <dd>Microscopy (1974-1994)</dd>
                
            <dt>Public MeSH Note</dt><dd>95</dd>
        
            <dt>History Note</dt><dd>95</dd>
        
        


        
