            <dt>Concept UI</dt><dd>M0028041</dd>

            
                <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Microscopy in which television cameras are used to brighten magnified images that are otherwise too dark to be seen with the naked eye. It is used frequently in <a href="/record/ui?ui=D019113" class="textLink_TELEPATHOLOGY">TELEPATHOLOGY</a>.</dd>
            

